# Regal Bunnicorn's power and toughness are set by a characteristic-defining ability (CR 604.3), so Dress Down, which makes
# creatures lose all abilities, takes it away and the star counts as 0 (CR 208.2a): a Giant Growth keeps the 0/0 body alive as 3/3
# (it was 7/7 with the ability: the Bunnicorn and three Moxen make four nonland permanents, plus three).

